        <exercise workspace="1.5in">
            <p>
                Lily drank 3/8 of a bottle of water in the morning and 2/8 of the bottle in the afternoon. What fraction of the bottle did Lily drink in total?
            </p>
        </exercise>
        <exercise workspace="1.5in">
            <p>
                A pizza was cut into 10 equal slices. If 7/10 of the pizza was eaten, what fraction of the pizza is left?
            </p>
        </exercise>
        <exercise workspace="1.5in">
            <p>
                Noah spent 4/6 of an hour doing homework and 1/6 of an hour reading. How much time did he spend on both activities altogether?
            </p>
        </exercise>
        <exercise workspace="1.0in">
            Emma had 9/12 of a chocolate bar. She gave 5/12 of it to her friend. What fraction of the chocolate bar does Emma have now?
        </exercise>
